// The protocol between hikyaku (the host) and an out-of-process plugin.
//
// hikyaku starts the plugin binary with hashicorp/go-plugin: the magic
// cookie HIKYAKU_PLUGIN, protocol version 1, gRPC over a Unix socket with
// AutoMTLS. The plugin serves this service (plus go-plugin's
// grpc.health.v1.Health, GRPCController and GRPCStdio services).
//
// A plugin declares the kinds it serves with Describe. hikyaku opens one
// handle per source or destination of the spec that uses one of those
// kinds, and then calls the handle. Failures of a source or a sink travel
// inside the responses (Error), not as gRPC statuses, so their class
// survives; a gRPC status means the call itself failed (an unknown
// handle, a dead plugin). The host's deadline crosses every call as the
// gRPC deadline.

